{"id":"prepositions-0034","taskId":"prepositions","title":"Drill set 34","text":null,"source":"drill","gaps":[{"answer":"with","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"They provided us ___ everything we needed.","hint":"provide sb ___ sth","explanation":"provide somebody WITH something, or provide something FOR somebody."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Please forgive me ___ interrupting.","hint":"forgive sb ___ sth","explanation":"forgive somebody FOR something/doing something."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Critics attacked the film ___ its slow pace.","hint":"criticise sth ___ sth","explanation":"criticise/criticize something FOR a reason."},{"answer":"with","accept":["to"],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"He\u0027s not very friendly ___ his new colleagues.","hint":"friendly ___ sb","explanation":"friendly WITH somebody = on good terms; a friendly person is friendly TO others."},{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The film had an immediate effect ___ audiences.","hint":"effect ___ sth","explanation":"have an effect ON somebody/something."},{"answer":"to","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Her style is similar ___ her sister\u0027s.","hint":"similar ___ sth","explanation":"similar TO something (never \u0027than\u0027)."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"She apologised ___ being so late.","hint":"apologise ___ sth","explanation":"apologise FOR something/doing something."},{"answer":"after","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Could you look ___ my plants while I\u0027m away?","hint":"look ___ = take care of","explanation":"look AFTER somebody/something = take care of them."}]}